 :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The size of the divisor from which schoolbook division takes two quotient limbs per pass, by\none multiply-subtract pass with two rows (`Schoolbook.divLoop2In`): always, as measured on Zen 3.","docLink":"./MPN32/Config.html#MPN.W32.Config.div2Rows","kind":"def","line":98,"name":"MPN.W32.Config.div2Rows","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Config.lean#L98-L98"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Config.html#MPN.W32.Config.div32Recip\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">div32Recip</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./MPN32/Config.html#MPN.W32.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The size of a normalized divisor from which schoolbook division estimates the quotient limbs\nby GMP's 3-by-2 steps with a precomputed reciprocal instead of the hardware divider: always, like\nGMP's `mpn_sbpi1_div_qr`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Config.html#MPN.W32.Config.div32Recip","kind":"def","line":95,"name":"MPN.W32.Config.div32Recip","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Config.lean#L95-L95"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Config.html#MPN.W32.Config.div1Recip\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">div1Recip</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<sp